ing Boot 2.7.0 is an older version. For optimal Java 17 support, Spring Boot 2.7.14+ or preferably 3.x should be used. Spring Boot 3.x requires migration from javax.* to jakarta.* packages.\",\n      \"filePath\": \"Component /pom.xml\",\n      \"lineNumber\": 23,\n      \"codeSnippet\": \"<dependency>\\n    <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>\\n    <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-web</artifactId>\\n    <version>2.7.0</version>\\n</dependency>\",\n      \"impact\": \"Current version works with Java 17 but is outdated. Missing security patches and performance improvements. If upgrading to Spring Boot 3.x, will require jakarta.* package migration.\",\n      \"remediation\": \"Update Spring Boot to 2.7.18 (latest 2.x) for minimal changes, or consider upgrading to Spring Boot 3.2.x for long-term support. Spring Boot 3.x requires javax.* to jakarta.* package migration.\",\n      \"effort\": \"medium\",\n      \"breakingChange\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"issue-3\",\n      \"severity\": \"medium\",\n      \"category\": \"maven-dependencies\",\n      \"title\": \"MySQL Connector Version Compatibility\",\n      \"description\": \"mysql-connector-java artifact is deprecated. The recommended artifact is now com.mysql:mysql-connector-j. Version 8.0.33 works with Java 17 but newer versions available.\",\n      \"filePath\": \"Component /pom.xml\",\n      \"lineNumber\": 19,\n      \"codeSnippet\": \"<dependency>\\n    <groupId>mysql</groupId>\\n    <artifactId>mysql-connector-java</artifactId>\\n    <version>8.0.33</version>\\n</dependency>\",\n      \"impact\": \"Using deprecated artifact name. While functional, should migrate to the new artifact for future compatibility and updates.\",\n      \"remediation\": \"Change groupId to 'com.mysql' and artifactId to 'mysql-connector-j'. Update to version 8.2.0 or later. Update driver class name in code if needed (though backward compatible).\",\n      \"effort\": \"low\",\n      \"breakingChange\": false\n    },\n 